WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.183
Hello there.

00:00:01.183 --> 00:00:02.016
Welcome to this video.

00:00:02.016 --> 00:00:04.600
Now, one of my all-time
complaints about The Slo Mo Guys

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.800
is that we haven't yet blown
up anything really big.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.280
So it's been quite small things.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.933
So hopefully this video will fix that.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.900
So the setup is five cooling towers,

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.360
each of them extremely tall and high.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.530
They are gonna detonate two seconds apart.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:36.510
We're gonna shoot about
300 frames a second.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.001
350 I think is what I set it to.

00:00:39.001 --> 00:00:41.410
That's because it is so big,

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.837
if I shot slower it would
literally be just paused

00:00:43.837 --> 00:00:45.100
in the air.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.483
So I think 300 will be good for this.

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:08.454
That's quite a different landscape now.

